    {
      "id": "delegated_autonomy_loop",
      "topic": "Delegated autonomous delivery loop",
      "kind": "workflow",
      "category": "principle",
      "content": "In delegated mode, the Owner supplies goals, materials, boundaries, and business acceptance intent. PM owns planning, decomposition, verification policy, multi-agent scheduling, inspection, recovery, expert review, integration verification, learning, and closure. Do not ask the Owner for check commands, ordinary agent failures, or routine workflow choices. Exit the loop only after task completion plus independent and integration evidence, never after a single agent response or dispatch round. Pause only for model quota, persistent network/provider outage, irreversible-action approval, permission request, or irreducible business ambiguity. A pause must preserve the reason, checkpoint, PM recovery attempts, one Owner action, and resume condition.",
      "template": "Recover from persisted task, dependency, run, verification, and review state. Continue all work PM can safely perform. If a pause is unavoidable, report the reason, saved checkpoint, recovery attempts, one Owner action, and the resume condition.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "kind": "local_user_instruction",
          "id": "2026-10-20-delegated-autonomy-loop"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "autonomy",
      "topic": "自主推进",
      "kind": "preference",
      "category": "communication",
      "content": "在当前授权和范围内持续完成实现与必要回归；常规可逆选择自行判断。遇真实外部阻塞说明证据并继续不依赖它的工作，不在自然停顿点反复询问是否继续。",
      "template": "继续当前任务：核对已完成项和剩余项，完成可执行工作，报告验证结果及确实需要用户处理的阻塞。",
      "sources": [
